Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉古)我用拉格纳·无限
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击索尔·马里奥内特！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)哎呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝… 我为你报仇了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场胜利正是因为有你赐予我的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)哈哈哈哈。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可没那么容易啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在被攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动了咚·千尊王座的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.42,0:00:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当比自己生命值攻击力更高的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的怪兽区域被攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将装备在我身上的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚·千尊王座送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使战斗无效结束这个回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 竟然有那种效果…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.39,0:00:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.69,0:01:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后剩下的效果是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将受到攻击的怪兽混沌化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让它升阶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 魂之马里奥内特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ CNo.43！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.41,0:01:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魂魄傀儡鬼神 混沌·马里奥内特！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)机内气压 无异常。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}距离月面 还有1光子英里。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)那里就是 银河眼 的诞生之地。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？ 银河眼… 这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(冲击音)\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(冲击音)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(警报声)
