Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法解析！ 全系统异常！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.73,0:03:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)切换！ 星光模式！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(地鸣)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轰隆)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 用魔法卡把自己的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从战士族变成兽族了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轰隆)虽然不知道你瞄准的是什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了巴利安之力的你还能做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)阿里特……(游马)糟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)不他的目标 恐怕是……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)上吧 基拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.33,0:04:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 成为兽族的等级2的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只大蜂后超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.53,0:04:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出额外卡组！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.64！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古狸三太夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.65,0:04:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！？我遗迹里的 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……唔哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(蓬太)蓬 蓬 蓬 蓬 蓬！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.精灵 蓬太参上蓬！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蓬太！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还活着！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就是蓬太啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让他恢复理智把力量借给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}包在我身上蓬！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了！蓬太！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古狸三太夫的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量素材取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
