Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击巨人拳红手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你疯了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算攻击力相同{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.89,0:06:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽不是 No.怪兽的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是破坏不了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我早就知道了！
