Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽被战斗破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏它的对方怪兽的攻击力变成零{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
