Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒混沌超量 No.怪兽的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉格的咒缚就能解开！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 古狸三太夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.51,0:06:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击巨手浣熊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.35,0:06:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 基拉格大人 上吧嘭！
