Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起来 基拉格！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你真正的记忆！
