Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 根据混沌·马里奥内塔的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌·超载·单元的数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以攻击！ 也就是说我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这家伙可以攻击3次！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 攻击力终究只有500。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本打不过我的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就 试试看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用魂魄衍生物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击拉格纳·无限！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 要自爆！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵 又可惜了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魂魄TOKEN在战斗中不会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害也会无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)而且还会将无效化的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害部分{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用来提升混沌·马里奥内特的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 第二轮！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击拉格纳· infinity！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 混沌·马里奥内特的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.09,0:09:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 第三轮攻击了～。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 魂魄TOKEN！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)住手 贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:10:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的命就给你了 所以……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.41,0:10:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.83,0:10:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃 我……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 我和贝库塔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被堂·萨赞多。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 有栖！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从堂·萨赞多的咒缚中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你解放出来看来是做到了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}害我费了这么大功夫……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 有栖！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.14,0:10:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.14,0:10:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗还没结束呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的陷阱卡 最后反击。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把攻击力变成零的怪兽破坏掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.38,0:10:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那场战斗结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的怪兽原本的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同的伤害 由我来承受！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不可能那样的话有栖 你……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古 你可是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我最好的兄弟啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于 有点像个朋友的样子做到了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 有栖……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光体 还有小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.81,0:11:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉啊。明明你们相信我会赢的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你们还有把千尊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒的任务留着呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能在这种地方让你们受伤啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂等等啊 有栖！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 能遇见你真是热血沸腾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有栖！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…… 有栖！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有栖！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有栖！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.99,0:12:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…… 贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.51,0:12:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 混沌大魔神的攻击力就{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成18600了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 做好觉悟了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦，梅拉格！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.69,0:12:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌·马里奥内特！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击拉格纳·无限！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.13,0:12:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（（凌牙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能与你一起{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走过这两段命运我很幸福……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，已经要告别了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}活下去……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你从今往后也要坚强地活下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 不要忘记……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.09,0:13:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你绝对不是孤身一人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了 凌牙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！））
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.89,0:13:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我命运的…终焉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凌牙… 我想更多地…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你在一起》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.41,0:14:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 这样一来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.63,0:14:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝和梅拉格的力量就是我的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量涌上来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的还有4只！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咚·萨赞德)贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快赶往基拉古那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生了不妙的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.15,0:14:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)凯特大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从地球确认到能量物体！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在朝这边过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗，米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.62,0:15:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)啊啊… 我听到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那银河眼之卡的咆哮！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆的儿子们说过的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙传说之地……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是V {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是引以为傲的兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们为了给你和游马争取出发的时间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己主动牺牲了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔。这里正是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.代码之钥沉睡的地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.代码之钥……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊，阿里特……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易才成为同伴的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么……到底是为什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我……是我把阿里特。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把阿里特和我的真正记忆……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙……上千主上他……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……不可原谅。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.33,0:16:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅，上千主上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）库库库库……哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。基拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)啧… 碍事的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.17,0:16:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用无聊的感情{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.81,0:16:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的心出现了缝隙 趁这个时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把灵魂一网打尽我本来想全部夺走的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果只有基拉古 不行吗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 基拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么… 为什么替我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 我最好的朋友{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拼了命 想要保护你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.81,0:17:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 那我也…。你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}后面就交给你了。游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(嘭太)基拉古大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.34,0:17:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再也不会分开了嘭永远在一起嘭！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.46,0:17:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘭太……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.55,0:17:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 快点过来呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘭太！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋 贝库塔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量 涌上来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟 多鲁贝和梅拉古的灵魂也
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚刚才收下呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.81,0:17:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！ 那是骗人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.48,0:17:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 梅拉古…… 不 璃绪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以前 是同伴来着啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.97,0:17:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过分了。贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵…… 七皇的力量全部收下了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒你们，用奴梅隆代码，我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将成为全能之神！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟你们这群家伙打得等收拾完纳修之后。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好期待等着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.45,0:18:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有神之力的卡 奴梅隆代码{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅凭其存在是无法发挥作用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要让它发挥作用需要特殊的钥匙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而作为其基础的是两张银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.78,0:18:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在与金隆战斗的遗迹中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发现了刻有奴梅隆代码诞生传说的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.85,0:18:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}石碑。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:18:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((金隆：快斗 果然
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还是到达了这里啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}金伦……。这里所描绘的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙族所创的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.19,0:19:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《尼梅隆代码》诞生的秘密。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.47,0:19:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙族是远比人类
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有漫长寿命{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}且拥有万物智慧的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.95,0:19:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此人类
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}敬仰龙族，有时也畏惧龙族{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与它们共同生存至今。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在世界初始之时曾有一条龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而因唯有自己存在的孤独{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那条龙用尽所有力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}创造了这个世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，耗尽力量的龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即将终结自己的生命。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.66,0:19:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙忧虑着自己的死亡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忧虑着自己所造世界的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法守护下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.85,0:19:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}于是 它用尽最后的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}落下了一滴眼泪。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙的心意与真相孕育其中的 那滴眼泪{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.61,0:20:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在无尽的宇宙中徘徊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终 抵达了某颗星球。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那颗星球就是地球。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.97,0:20:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 因为那冲击月亮就此诞生了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 所谓龙的眼泪…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。 No.代码{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自身置于地球。 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将化为钥匙的部分置于月球。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步 预见到如今的危机{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}龙借助了 No.众的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其存在化为隐秘之物。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将一切 过去 未来改写
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对神之力 施以龙的诅咒))
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)光与时空之龙 于诞生之地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当彼此对峙之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河之瞳 真正睁开{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开启新世界的大门。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}石碑上 如此写着。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.09,0:21:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光与时的龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·光子·龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.28,0:21:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以及 快子·龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那2体 在此地战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜利者方能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解开 numerals code 的诅咒{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.45,0:21:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得钥匙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.97,0:21:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若那传说属实{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2体的龙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是以同样的 巴利安之力制成的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 巴利安才是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}numerals code 真正的拥有者！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.48,0:21:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实。 若照现在这样下去的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.13,0:21:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 你什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错。 石碑上所示的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.79,0:21:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一体的龙… 那个是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那事 打一场就知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.28,0:21:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 现在正是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决出谁才是最强驭龙使的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.14,0:22:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 说得没错 米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.85,0:22:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)决斗！

